{"id": "port-security-grant-vendor-check", "title": "The Port could not document its vendor check. Auditors found no suspension or debarment.", "seconds": 52.7, "voice": "tinyvoca:F2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "a408005f24c00e84", "words": 151, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Port of San Francisco had a $698,625 federal security grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.42, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Federal", "grant"], "sub": "The City approved a $698,625 grant for two purposes"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City approved funding for training, exercises and fencing.", "t0": 6.54, "t1": 9.77, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "resolution", "kicker": "The City approved a $698,625 grant for two purposes", "text": "Two purposes", "mark": "Two"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In fiscal 2015 auditors tested one of two contracts.", "t0": 9.99, "t1": 13.37, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "sample", "layout": "table", "heading": "Audit sample", "context": "Port security procurement", "rows": [{"label": "Contracts available", "value": "2"}, {"label": "Contracts tested", "value": "1"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The file lacked evidence of an eligibility check before the contract was signed.", "t0": 13.49, "t1": 17.61, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sample", "kicker": "The tested contract file lacked a dated eligibility check", "text": "Eligibility check", "mark": "Eligibility"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors checked the federal list themselves. They found no suspension or debarment.", "t0": 17.73, "t1": 22.66, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sample", "kicker": "The tested contract file lacked a dated eligibility check", "text": "Auditor check", "mark": "Auditor"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They questioned no costs.", "t0": 22.78, "t1": 24.22, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sample", "kicker": "The tested contract file lacked a dated eligibility check", "text": "No questioned costs", "mark": "No"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The original audit dates a federal closure letter to September 2015.", "t0": 24.34, "t1": 28.31, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "originalclose", "kicker": "The reports agree on closure but differ on the year", "text": "Original audit", "mark": "Original"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The following report gives the same month and day in 2016.", "t0": 28.43, "t1": 31.91, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "next", "layout": "table", "heading": "Federal closure letter", "context": "Two audit summaries", "rows": [{"label": "Original audit", "value": "September 23, 2015"}, {"label": "Next audit", "value": "September 23, 2016"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Both reports say the issue was closed.", "t0": 32.03, "t1": 34.13, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "originalclose", "kicker": "The reports agree on closure but differ on the year", "text": "Closure", "mark": "Closure"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2017 a federal transaction reduced the award by about $188,877.", "t0": 34.35, "t1": 41.25, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "transactions", "kicker": "The federal award subsequently decreased", "text": "Federal obligation", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The net obligation was $509,748.", "t0": 41.37, "t1": 45.53, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fed", "layout": "table", "heading": "Federal obligation", "context": "Whole dollars", "rows": [{"label": "Initial", "value": "$698,625"}, {"label": "Final", "value": "$509,748"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The federal award record does not tie that reduction to the vendor check.", "t0": 45.65, "t1": 49.16, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reason undisclosed"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 49.28, "t1": 51.76, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The City approved a $698,625 grant for two purposes", "b": "The tested contract file lacked a dated eligibility check", "o": "The federal award subsequently decreased"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}